  "prefLabel": "Tax 215.01 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tax 215.01 Applicability. This part, as well as Tax 101, Tax 201, and Tax 202, shall apply to all appeals of discretionary easement, revitalization, betterment assessment, qualifying historic buildings, farm structures and land under farm structures’, and qualifying chartered public school appeals under RSA 79-C, RSA 79-D, RSA 79-E, RSA 79-F:6, RSA 79-G:5, RSA 79-H:5, and RSA 231:32.\n\nSource. #7874-B, eff 4-18-03; ss by #8987-A, eff 9-24-07; ss by #9538, eff 9-8-09; ss by #10625-B, eff 6-26-14; ss by #13711-B, eff 8-2-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/tax100-500.html"
